</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="547.11" endTime="551.342">
<Sync time="547.11"/>
A:mo yehwa, oksé:, mm.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="551.342" endTime="555.073">
<Sync time="551.342"/>
I:pa yehwa sah, a:mo tikelna:miki ok.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="555.073" endTime="562.996">
<Sync time="555.073"/>
